## The runtime marks

The install rows each lead with the mark of a runtime — bun, npm, pnpm — in the brand's own logo, not a redrawing. Each logo is the project's official SVG, vendored in `logos.json` and dropped into a span as inline markup, so the page carries no image file and the mark stays sharp at any size. Each keeps its own colours: npm's red block, pnpm's yellow-and-grey squares, bun's cream mascot.

=>

const svgMark = (svg: string): Html =>
  h.span([h.Class('rt-logo'), h.InnerHTML(svg)], [])

export const bunIcon = (): Html => svgMark(logos.bun)
export const npmIcon = (): Html => svgMark(logos.npm)
export const pnpmIcon = (): Html => svgMark(logos.pnpm)

